# Google Maps JavaScript API key.
# See README.md > "Configuration Google Cloud" for how to create and restrict this key.
# This key is embedded in the client bundle by design (Maps JS API requires it client-side) —
# its protection comes from HTTP referrer + API restrictions in Google Cloud Console,
# NOT from keeping it secret. Never commit a real key to this repository.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
